      "text": "int targetFriendArrivalTime = times[targetFriend][0]; // 3\n\nArrays.sort(times, (a, b) -> a[0] - b[0]);\n\nint[] chairs = new int[times.length]; // end time of chair\n\nfor (int i = 0; i < times.length; i = i + 1) {\n    for (int j = 0; j < chairs.length; j = j + 1) {\n        if (times[i][0] >= chairs[j]) {\n            if (targetFriendArrivalTime == times[i][0]) {\n                return j;\n            }\n            chairs[j] = times[i][1];\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nreturn -1;",
